\[
\Delta_{f} G^{o} = \Delta_{f} G^{o}(\mathrm{products}) - \Delta_{f} G^{o}(\mathrm{reactants})
\]

For the conversion of graphite to diamond, the reactants are graphite and the products are diamond. The standard state Gibbs free energies of formation are given as:

\[
